claim.claim-text:
an array of airfoils (66, 166, 266, 366, 466, 566) circumferentially distributed about the outer periphery (62C... 762C), each one of the airfoils (66...566) including an airfoil section (66A, 166A, 266A, 366A, 566A) extending from a root section (66B, 266B, 366B, 466B, 566B) received in the annular channels (62D... 862D);
a plurality of retention pins (68, 168, 368, 468, 568, 868, 968), each one of the retention pins (68...968) extending through the root section (66B...566B) of a respective one of the airfoils (66...566) and through the array of annular flanges (62B...962B) to mechanically attach the root section (66B...566B) to the hub (62...962); and
an array of platforms (70, 270, 370, 470) mechanically attached to the hub (62...962) and that abut against respective pairs of the airfoils (66...566) radially outward of the retention pins (68... 968).

a fan section (22, 422) including a fan shaft (64, 464) rotatable about an engine longitudinal axis (X);
at least one bearing assembly (38, 438) supporting the fan shaft (64, 464); and
wherein the fan section (22, 422) includes the rotor assembly (60...960) as recited in any of claims 2 to 8, wherein the main body (62A... 862A) of the rotor assembly (60...960) is mechanically attached to the fan shaft (64, 464).
